<title>UK: Quebec prices $750 mln 10-yr global bond, +58 b.p..</title>
<headline>Quebec prices $750 mln 10-yr global bond, +58 b.p..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following global bond has been priced, joint lead managers Merrill Lynch, CSFB, Goldman Sachs, Nomura and SBC Warburg said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The deal was launched Wednesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   QUEBEC, PROVINCE OF</p>
<p> AMT	  $750 MLN  COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    30.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.166    PAY DATE    30.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  37.5 BP   REOFFER    99.166    SPREAD	+58 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  CANADA    MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC   0.30</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.5 PCT OCT 2006 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
